{"parse": {"title": "DPL-05", "pageid": 69795, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DPL-04\" title=\"DPL-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DPL-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/DPL-06\" title=\"DPL-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DPL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AF.B9.E6.95.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"对数\">对数</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 对数</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Logarithm</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>需<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>次<span class=\"color-value\"></span>对<span class=\"color-value\"></span>求<span class=\"color-value\"></span>幂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>算<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191705</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在店主做出了“倒闭宣言”后，场面陷入了短暂的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你说倒闭？倒闭是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>呃，就是“关门大吉”，一家店经营不下去了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我当然知道什么是“倒闭”，还用你给我解释？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提问者堪称蛮不讲理地打断了对方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>难道我又要回归机灵蛋筒家？但它家负责外送的卡邦克鲁每次都会偷吃！我去投诉，他们居然说那是“正常损耗”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你们是说，以后都不能买到这个冰淇淋了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本已打算离开的女孩也停在了原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那个美丽的正十二角星，以及它神奇的、清爽又浓厚的味道……下次我到这里来的时候，就尝不到了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>让人开心的、美丽的事物，却再也见不到它们了。这听起来不是一个让人高兴的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37思考了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我必须承认，现在的我对经济学知识了解得并不多。可这家商店销售的冰淇淋如此美丽，却居然会倒闭……这听起来并不合理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……这样吧！我来帮助你解决这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来方才的道别操之过急了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxueshiyanshi\"><img alt=\"daxueshiyanshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/600px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/900px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——所以，问题就在这里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在一系列令店主头晕目眩的有关数字的提问后，小小的顾问吃着她免费获得的又一支冰淇淋，宣布自己解开了谜底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这张图表标志着你和其他店铺数据之间的差距，你的进店人数和客单价都显著低于其他的商店，这就是问题所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>只要提高这两个数字，你的烦恼就能迎刃而解了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>是吗？呃……你是说哪个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主凑近那张图表，努力分辨上面每一条线与每一个点之间的关系，但显然未能取得明显进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>搞什么，你还来真的？这是哪里，什么无聊的情景喜剧片场吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>这里是我的私人实验室，只为足够天才的想法而生！而你这个数字名字，现在居然在我的黑板上写冰淇淋的盈亏平衡分析图！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我必须指正你：这里并不是你的私人实验室。但……说实话，我也开始对自己还在这里的原因感到迷茫了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不要这样嘛，我的朋友们。我们都清楚其中的理由：这很有趣不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>拜托，什么事很有趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>研究“一个不懂经营的家伙经营的冰淇淋店为什么会倒闭”这样的愚蠢问题？答案一目了然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你怎么能够指望一个在被问到“你每天亏多少钱”时，回答“我也不知道具体的，但感觉不少”的人能把生意干明白？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>嘿！我忍你很久了，我都听得到！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>你每次都会提一些无礼的要求，像是吃到只剩蛋筒了却叫我给你续杯……我都满足你了！现在你居然在这里说风凉话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我只是指出了事实。有的人只擅长做一件事，但做其他事就都一塌糊涂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你调的冰淇淋很好吃，但做生意一团糟。你为什么不考虑卖掉你的配方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主语塞，脸慢慢涨红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>……你不是吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>对……对！我承认，这是我的梦想！拥有一家冰淇淋商店！我不想就这么放弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主从翻着白眼的兔毛手袋那里背过脸去，重新面向她唯一的救星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>我本来想着认命了，但你们出现了。你真的能帮我吗，小姑娘？你刚才说……提高什么东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>客单价和进店人数。你看，你的客单价相比其他商店，只有它们的大约三分之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>而你的进店人数也只有平均每天63人，这并不是一个足够大的因数。所以这就是你会亏本的原因：你的营业额太低了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>其实我觉得63个人也不少啊？你想，六十多个人呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你乐观得让人害怕，看看外头的商店吧！机灵蛋筒家的冰淇淋车前面每天都大排长龙，他们一天至少卖出三百个冰淇淋！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你要感谢爱兹拉那小子没打算利用博物馆里的商店创收，不然你亏得更惨。要我说，他就是少了点经济头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>好吧好吧！算你说的对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主摆手投降，重新端详起了37在笔记本上画出的表格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后……她做出了一个拉普拉斯科算中心少有人能够做出的决定：质疑这个女孩的结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>但我卖的是冰淇淋，其它那些商店卖的是纪念品之类的，它们的客单价当然比我的高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>如果把冰淇淋提到和它们一个价钱……呃，虽然我对我冰淇淋的味道有信心，但说实话我不觉得大家会买账。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……是这样吗？冰淇淋不值得更高的价格？明明它有着那样漂亮的正十二角星形？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对物价并不了解的数学家愕然了片刻，最终谦虚地接受了这一对她知识盲区的指正。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>那么我们就只剩下进店人数了。让我们把进店人数提高吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>只要把这个数字拉到原本的2.56倍，我们就可以实现收支平衡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>虽然我其实不太喜欢这个说法，2.56并不是一个准确的数字，它只不过是一个十进制下的近似值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>2.56？呃，用它乘上进店人数的63个人，那就是……大概……呃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你看，这就是不得不取近似值的弊端了，你会得到161.28这个结果，但其实我们讨论的这个数字是161。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯……这有些反直觉，161是一个亏数，它的所有真因数之和实际上比它自身更小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>所以我认为当你完成161这个目标之后，也许可以去追寻更好的数字，例如它的下一个回文数，171。然后是181、191、202……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>等等、等等！请先暂停一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管没有听懂眼前的女孩究竟是使用怎样的运算方法提出了一个又一个数字的，但店主显然注意到这个数字越来越大了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>先……先让我们从最初的目标开始吧，你要我一天卖出161个冰淇淋？但这怎么可能？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>那岂不是超级多人？每天那么多人来我店里，我怎么可能忙得过来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这个担心是多余的，我看到你的营业时间是每天上午十点到晚上六点，所以你只需要平均每2.98……取近似值，每3分钟卖出一个冰淇淋就可以了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我没有在你为我们打冰淇淋的时候掐表，但我模拟了一遍这个过程，如果顺利的话，它能够在30秒内完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我不认为这是一件不可能的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主的眼神开始飘向远方，显然她正在脑内模拟每三分钟便有一个客人光顾、而自己在半分钟之内为他们的每一个依次递上冰淇淋的情景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>我……我不知道，也许可以试试？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被说服了。然后——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她问出了那个关键的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>那怎么才能让进我店的人数变成原来的2.56倍？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>让我想想……嗯…………嗯………………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天赋卓绝的数学家张了张嘴，又合上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌后，她才终于试着给出了答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>乘上2.56，然后减去0.28？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>………………啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>哈哈！我说什么来着？你不能只是说“提高一下这个数字就好了”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蛰伏许久的围观者终于抓到了喷吐毒液的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>欢迎来到现实世界，小数学家。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——也许有些突然，但我想是时候让我们重新审视一番“数学”的意义了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>许多人认为数学的世界过于抽象，难以理解，于是对数学望而生畏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这不能怪他们。一个苹果，一个人，一件事，一次成功或失败……这些都很好理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但当数字第一次脱离了它们所数的实际对象，当“1”成为了“1”——只是“1”的时候，数学就已经脱离了我们所熟悉的物质世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>被肉身束缚的我们于是只能追逐着那些数字。人们学习与研究数学，实际上是通过那些数字，借用来自那个超越的世界的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>在那个世界，“空无一物”以0的形态堂而皇之地跃然纸上，负数理所当然般站在“存在”的另一端，就连“无穷”都能够被列入公式中计算……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>在数学的世界中我们无所不能——至少，理论上是这样。我们的思维是自由的，它不再受到现实的桎梏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>只有少部分人能够理解这种自由的魅力，也只有少数人真正拥有在数学世界中无所不能的力量。就像是我们这位可爱的新朋友一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——但是，这里有一个小问题。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxueshiyanshi\"><img alt=\"daxueshiyanshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/600px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/900px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默的听众盯着侃侃而谈的研究员看了一会儿后，冷酷地移开了视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一般人会在这时感到尴尬，然后停止自说自话。但未知数显然不是个普通的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>帮我个忙。你这个时候应该接“什么问题？”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>………………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听众仍然以无情的沉默回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……这个问题就是：数学无所不能，但要让它的力量在现实中生效，我们实际上一共需要执行三个步骤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>第一步，将一个现实问题抽象成一个数学问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>第二步，在你拥有无所不能神力的数学世界中解决这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>最后一步，带着你的答案，回到现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的听众明白他的意思了。小梅斯梅尔的目光望向屋外。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>过往数据显示这个季度平均每天的进馆人数是9837，每天的营业时间是八个小时，因此三个小时过去了，应当有大约3689个人进入场馆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>嘿，你知道每个时间段进入博物馆的人数并不一致，对吧？存在“高峰期”这么个玩意，这是常识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>即使如此差距也实在太大了。在这段时间里，只有457个人进入到了能够看到商店招牌的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>大家不会来冰淇淋店所在的这个休息区，这就是问题所在！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-563801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">店主：</div><div>啊？四百多个人听起来很多了啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>拜托，有种东西叫做进店率。不是这四百个人都会来的，你失忆了吗？刚才只有20个人过来买冰淇淋！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>也就是说只有大约12%的参观者会到这个休息区来。必须得承认……这个数字比我想象中的还要少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>怪不得我总是愿意来这家店坐坐。这里不会有太多聒噪的家伙打扰我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>但是为什么大家不会来呢？我不明白。等等，这张地图……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>能够在几秒钟内解决科算中心“滞销”一年有余难题的脑袋，如今埋首于一个有关冰淇淋以及形形色色参观者的小小谜题中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>她正在进行第三步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我明白了……！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DPL-05"}}